          "output": "    1   0.000000000    10.0.0.5 → 10.0.0.1      ICMP 74 Echo (ping) request  id=0x1234, seq=0/0, ttl=64\n    2   0.100000000    10.0.0.5 → 10.0.0.1      ICMP 74 Echo (ping) request  id=0x1234, seq=1/0, ttl=64\n    3   0.400000000    10.0.0.5 → 10.0.0.1      ICMP 74 Echo (ping) request  id=0x1234, seq=2/0, ttl=64\n    4   0.700000000    10.0.0.5 → 10.0.0.1      ICMP 74 Echo (ping) request  id=0x1234, seq=3/0, ttl=64\n    5   1.000000000    10.0.0.5 → 10.0.0.1      ICMP 74 Echo (ping) request  id=0x1234, seq=4/0, ttl=64\n"
